Description: Keep the native ANTLR archive out of PGXS bitcode installation
 PGXS derives its bitcode input from OBJS. Link the native archive through
 SHLIB_LINK instead; SHLIB_LINK_INTERNAL also enters exported LDFLAGS and
 breaks the CMake bootstrap that creates the archive itself.
Author: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-06
--- a/contrib/babelfishpg_tsql/Makefile
+++ b/contrib/babelfishpg_tsql/Makefile
@@ -65 +65,2 @@
-OBJS += antlr/libantlr_tsql.a
+SHLIB_LINK += antlr/libantlr_tsql.a
+SHLIB_PREREQS += antlr/libantlr_tsql.a
